[{"id":"addon:deluge_of_fear:iridescent_videotape","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-27","title":"荧虹录像带","titleEn":"Iridescent Videotape","rarity":"ultra","description":["包含贞子诅咒的原始录像带。","·投射不会关停电视，不会施加咒怨状态。","·电视被逃生者关停后，重新打开所需时间增加20%。"],"flavor":"“那卷录像……那不是这个世界的东西。那是贞子的怒火。”——高山龙司","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_iridescentVideotape.webp","glyph":1,"confidence":1,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Iridescent_Videotape","pinyin":"yinghongluxiangdai","initials":"yhlxd"},{"id":"addon:deluge_of_fear:remote_control","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-27","title":"遥控器","titleEn":"Remote Control","rarity":"ultra","description":["小屋中录像机的遥控器。能使贞子专注于远处的敌人。","·使用投射后，在打开的电视12米范围内的逃生者向你暴露气场，持续7秒。"],"flavor":"“她仅靠意念就杀死了一个人。这种她母亲的力量有所不同。”——高山龙司","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_remoteControl.webp","glyph":3,"confidence":1,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Remote_Control","pinyin":"yaokongqi","initials":"ykq"},{"id":"addon:deluge_of_fear:tape_editing_deck","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-27","title":"录像带编辑台","titleEn":"Tape Editing Deck","rarity":"very-rare","description":["玲子和龙司用来分析和拷贝录像带的编辑台。只有拷贝并分发录像带才能不受怨咒所害。","·每名逃生者开局时均拥有一卷录像带，且其目标电视均位于最远位置。","·逃生者每次在目标电视中插入录像带后，暴露气场6秒。"],"flavor":"“在盐水中嬉戏，妖精就光临。”——贞子录像带中的隐藏信息。","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_tapeEditingDeck.webp","glyph":6,"confidence":1,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Tape_Editing_Deck","pinyin":"luxiangdaibianjitai","initials":"lxdbjt"},{"id":"addon:deluge_of_fear:vcr","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-27","title":"录像机","titleEn":"VCR","rarity":"very-rare","description":["播放贞子录像带的原始录像机。摸起来尚有余温。","·贞子投射至一处电视时，所有电视都会播放投射效果。"],"flavor":"","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_vcr.webp","glyph":6,"confidence":1,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/VCR","pinyin":"luxiangji","initials":"lxj"},{"id":"addon:deluge_of_fear:distorted_photo","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-27","title":"扭曲照片","titleEn":"Distorted Photo","rarity":"very-rare","description":["看过录像带的人发现所有关于他们的照片都被扭曲了，这提醒着他们即将面临的厄运。","·在16米范围内目睹现身的逃生者会尖叫并显示气场，持续4秒。"],"flavor":"“为什么只有你得救了？”——山村贞子","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_distortedPhoto.webp","glyph":6,"confidence":1,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Distorted_Photo","pinyin":"niuquzhaopian","initials":"nqzp"},{"id":"addon:deluge_of_fear:telephone","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-27","title":"电话","titleEn":"Telephone","rarity":"very-rare","description":["看过录像后，受害者会接到一通电话。意识到自己还有七天可活时，他们会因恐惧而手足无措。","· 现身使7米以内的逃生者受到3%减速状态影响，持续3秒。","减速会降低逃生者移动速度。"],"flavor":"“我昨天看了一卷奇怪的录像……结束后我们接到了一通电话。就是那种恶作剧电话。”——大石智子","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_telephone.webp","glyph":3,"confidence":1,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Telephone","pinyin":"dianhua","initials":"dh"},{"id":"addon:deluge_of_fear:well_water","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-27","title":"井水","titleEn":"Well Water","rarity":"rare","description":["贞子被遗弃的那口井中的水。它那浑浊的黑色能遮蔽周围的一切。","·以任意方式现身后的无法侦测状态持续时间增加2秒。","无法侦测状态会隐藏杀手的气场、恐惧范围与红光。"],"flavor":"","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_wellWater.webp","glyph":3,"confidence":1,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Well_Water","pinyin":"jingshui","initials":"js"},{"id":"addon:deluge_of_fear:ring_drawing","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-27","title":"凶铃绘","titleEn":"Scourge Hook: Floods of Rage","rarity":"rare","description":["年幼的阳一所画的井内的样子。帮助那些被录像带诅咒的人只能带来不幸。","· 将持有录像带的逃生者挂上钩子后，其他逃生者会增加1格怨咒进度。"],"flavor":"","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_ringDrawing.webp","glyph":2,"confidence":1,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Ring_Drawing","pinyin":"xionglinghui","initials":"xlh"},{"id":"addon:deluge_of_fear:rickety_pinwheel","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-27","title":"快散架的风车","titleEn":"Rickety Pinwheel","rarity":"rare","description":["在伊豆大岛的山洞里发现的风车。即使没有风，它也会旋转，使看到或听到它的人迷失方向。","·逃生者在打开的电视8米范围内时会受到浑然不觉状态影响。此效果在电视关闭后仍会持续7秒。","浑然不觉状态会使逃生者无法听到或受到杀手的恐惧范围影响。"],"flavor":"","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_ricketyPinwheel.webp","glyph":1,"confidence":1,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Rickety_Pinwheel","pinyin":"kuaisanjiadefengche","initials":"ksjdfc"},{"id":"addon:deluge_of_fear:mother_s_comb","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-27","title":"母亲的梳子","titleEn":"Mother's Comb","rarity":"rare","description":["贞子的母亲在录像带中使用的梳子。当贞子盯着它时，她的念力会得到增强。","·关停电视会引起噪音提示。","·以任意方式被关停的电视会显示为黄色气场。"],"flavor":"","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_mothersComb.webp","glyph":2,"confidence":1,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Mother%27s_Comb","pinyin":"muqindeshuzi","initials":"mqdsz"},{"id":"addon:deluge_of_fear:bloody_fingernails","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-27","title":"血污指甲","titleEn":"Bloody Fingernails","rarity":"rare","description":["贞子的血淋淋的指甲，在她试图用手刨出通路离开井底时掉落了。这是她一心嗜杀的证据。","·投射的移动速度加成持续时间增加50%。"],"flavor":"","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_bloodyFingernails.webp","glyph":5,"confidence":1,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Bloody_Fingernails","pinyin":"xuewuzhijia","initials":"xwzj"},{"id":"addon:deluge_of_fear:clump_of_hair","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-27","title":"一团头发","titleEn":"Clump of Hair","rarity":"uncommon","description":["贞子曾经拥有一头美丽的长发，现在却用褴褛枯槁的头发遮住了面庞。","· 贞子隐身时的可见范围减少6米。"],"flavor":"","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_clumpOfHair.webp","glyph":3,"confidence":1,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Clump_of_Hair","pinyin":"yituantoufa","initials":"yttf"},{"id":"addon:deluge_of_fear:well_stone","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-27","title":"井中石","titleEn":"Well Stone","rarity":"uncommon","description":["贞子所困之井的一部分，其图像烙印在了每个看过录像带的人心中。","· 电视被逃生者关停后，重新打开所需时间减少7秒。"],"flavor":"","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_wellStone.webp","glyph":5,"confidence":1,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Well_Stone","pinyin":"jingzhongshi","initials":"jzs"},{"id":"addon:deluge_of_fear:sea_soaked_cloth","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-27","title":"浸泡海水的布料","titleEn":"Sea-Soaked Cloth","rarity":"uncommon","description":["录像带中的神秘人带的兜帽。能让靠近它的人无法相信自己所看到的东西。","· 逃生者在打开的电视8米范围内时会受到障目状态影响。此效果在电视关闭后仍会持续7秒。","障目状态会使逃生者无法看到气场。"],"flavor":"","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_seaSoakedCloth.webp","glyph":1,"confidence":1,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Sea-Soaked_Cloth","pinyin":"jinpaohaishuidebuliao","initials":"jphsdbl"},{